00:04:54.360 --> 00:04:55.648
Smash or pass?

00:04:55.648 --> 00:04:57.120
- Oh, smash.

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:00.184
- And he goes, "Do you want
something for your hair?"

00:05:00.184 --> 00:05:01.601
And I go, "What?"

00:05:04.620 --> 00:05:08.726
And he goes, "Do you want
something for your hair?"

00:05:08.726 --> 00:05:12.210
And I go, "I don't get it."

00:05:12.210 --> 00:05:13.043
He goes, "Has nobody told you

00:05:13.043 --> 00:05:15.330
